# Forever Fury Warrior: the user's priority (2026-10-18), from Berserker Stance, with every ability wowsims/forever's
# Fury rotation casts (docs/research/2026-10-18-fury-vs-wowsims.md, "Added from wowsims").

# Focus lines first, in tiers (1 highest). Overpower and Revenge only in the stance that allows them, never a swap for
# them. Heroic Strike and Cleave (on the next swing) are the lowest tier: at the rage cap (tier 1) they dump whatever
# comes next; below it (tier 2) they need their threshold and must leave the cost of Bloodthirst and Whirlwind when
# either comes off cooldown before the next main-hand swing (the no-clip rule; an unknown one reserves nothing).
# Rend and Thunder Clap are silent in Berserker Stance (their `nobuff`); Sunder Armor and Demoralizing Shout work in
# every stance. From wowsims: the cooldowns (trinkets, Death Wish, Sweeping Strikes) under Arms's boss gate and the
# cooldowns toggle; Execute after Bloodthirst and Whirlwind; then Hamstring under a Windfury Totem, the Berserker
# Stance return when Bloodthirst or Whirlwind is ready within its 0.1 s reaction time, Bloodrage, Berserker Rage
# with its talent and Battle Shout at 10 s or less; the last three and Hamstring keep wowsims's Delay Check
# (Bloodthirst and Whirlwind each 1.5 s away). Racials and potions are not in the list (see the note). Precombat:
# Battle Shout, then Charge (Battle Stance) or Intercept (Berserker Stance) to open; the engine needs a precombat list.

actions.precombat=battle_shout,if=buff.battle_shout.remains<=10
actions.precombat+=/charge,use_off_gcd=1
actions.precombat+=/intercept,use_off_gcd=1,if=buff.berserker_stance.up&action.intercept.in_range&!action.rend.in_range
actions=victory_rush,focus=1
actions+=/overpower,focus=1,if=buff.battle_stance.up
actions+=/revenge,focus=1,if=buff.defensive_stance.up
actions+=/heroic_strike,focus=1,use_off_gcd=1,if=active_enemies=1&rage>=settings.rage_cap_threshold
actions+=/heroic_strike,focus=2,use_off_gcd=1,if=active_enemies=1&rage>=settings.hs_threshold&(!action.bloodthirst.known|cooldown.bloodthirst.remains>mainhand_remains|rage.current-action.heroic_strike.cost>=action.bloodthirst.cost)&(!action.whirlwind.known|cooldown.whirlwind.remains>mainhand_remains|rage.current-action.heroic_strike.cost>=action.whirlwind.cost)
actions+=/cleave,focus=1,use_off_gcd=1,if=active_enemies>1&rage>=settings.rage_cap_threshold
actions+=/cleave,focus=2,use_off_gcd=1,if=active_enemies>1&rage>=settings.cleave_threshold&(!action.bloodthirst.known|cooldown.bloodthirst.remains>mainhand_remains|rage.current-action.cleave.cost>=action.bloodthirst.cost)&(!action.whirlwind.known|cooldown.whirlwind.remains>mainhand_remains|rage.current-action.cleave.cost>=action.whirlwind.cost)
actions+=/rend,if=!buff.berserker_stance.up&!debuff.rend.up
actions+=/sunder_armor,if=settings.debuff_sunder_enabled&debuff.sunder_armor.stack<settings.debuff_sunder_max_stack&!debuff.expose_armor.up&target.level>=settings.debuff_sunder_min_level
actions+=/call_action_list,name=cooldowns,if=boss|target.level>=level+3
actions+=/thunder_clap,if=settings.maintain_thunder_clap&!buff.berserker_stance.up&!debuff.thunder_clap.up
actions+=/demoralizing_shout,if=settings.debuff_demoshout_enabled&!debuff.demoralizing_shout.up
actions+=/bloodthirst
actions+=/whirlwind
actions+=/execute,if=execute_phase
actions+=/hamstring,if=buff.windfury.up&!execute_phase&(!action.bloodthirst.known|cooldown.bloodthirst.remains>=1.5)&(!action.whirlwind.known|cooldown.whirlwind.remains>=1.5)
actions+=/berserker_stance,use_off_gcd=1,if=action.bloodthirst.known&cooldown.bloodthirst.remains<=0.1|action.whirlwind.known&cooldown.whirlwind.remains<=0.1
actions+=/bloodrage,use_off_gcd=1,if=rage.current<90
actions+=/berserker_rage,if=talent.improved_berserker_rage.enabled&(!action.bloodthirst.known|cooldown.bloodthirst.remains>=1.5)&(!action.whirlwind.known|cooldown.whirlwind.remains>=1.5)
actions+=/battle_shout,if=buff.battle_shout.remains<=10&(!action.bloodthirst.known|cooldown.bloodthirst.remains>=1.5)&(!action.whirlwind.known|cooldown.whirlwind.remains>=1.5)
actions.cooldowns=use_items
actions.cooldowns+=/death_wish
actions.cooldowns+=/sweeping_strikes,use_off_gcd=1,if=active_enemies>1
